  "tutDash1Title": "Welcome to La Vida en Directo!",
  "tutDash1Desc": "Your personal music diary. The dashboard shows your upcoming concerts, key stats, friends' activity and much more at a glance.",
  "tutDash2Title": "Add a concert",
  "tutDash2Desc": "Tap the + button at any time to log a concert: artist, venue, date, price, photo and a detailed rating by criteria.",
  "tutDash3Title": "To rate",
  "tutDash3Desc": "The \"To rate\" widget lists past concerts that don't have a score yet. Swipe between them and tap one to rate it on 5 criteria.",
  "tutDash4Title": "Recommended concerts",
  "tutDash4Desc": "Discover upcoming events near you based on your artists. Tap one to see all its details.",
  "tutDash5Title": "Customize the dashboard",
  "tutDash5Desc": "Rearrange, show or hide the dashboard widgets by tapping the edit icon next to the greeting.",

  "tutAdd1Title": "Log the concert",
  "tutAdd1Desc": "Fill in artist, venue, city, date and price. The music genre is suggested automatically from Spotify as you type the artist's name.",
  "tutAdd2Title": "Concert photo",
  "tutAdd2Desc": "Add a photo from your gallery to bring the memory to life. You can change or remove it later from the edit screen.",
  "tutAdd3Title": "Rating by criteria",
  "tutAdd3Desc": "Rate 5 criteria with stars: Artist, Sound, Atmosphere, Setlist and Value for money. The overall score is calculated automatically as the average.",
  "tutAdd4Title": "Automatically calculated score",
  "tutAdd4Desc": "There is no manual score: the rating shown in your history and stats is always the average of your 5 criteria. Fairer and more detailed.",
  "tutAdd5Title": "Festival or single concert",
  "tutAdd5Desc": "Mark whether it was a festival so your stats can tell both formats apart and you can see the split in the \"Festival vs. individual\" section.",
  "tutAdd6Title": "Tag friends",
  "tutAdd6Desc": "Did you go with someone? Tag your friends so the concert also appears in their shared history and they can see it from their profile.",

  "tutDetail1Title": "Everything about the concert",
  "tutDetail1Desc": "Here you see the full info: date, venue, city, price, photo, your personal notes and the detailed rating by criteria with progress bars.",
  "tutDetail2Title": "Detailed rating",
  "tutDetail2Desc": "If you rated the concert, a card shows the score for each criterion: Artist, Sound, Atmosphere, Setlist and Value for money, plus the average.",
  "tutDetail3Title": "Edit anytime",
  "tutDetail3Desc": "Tap the edit button (pencil) to change any detail, add or modify the ratings, the photo or the notes whenever you want.",
  "tutDetail4Title": "Automatic setlist",
  "tutDetail4Desc": "The app looks up the concert's real setlist on Setlist.fm so you can relive, song by song, what they played that night.",
  "tutDetail5Title": "Artist on Spotify",
  "tutDetail5Desc": "The artist is linked automatically on Spotify: photo, genres, followers and the most popular songs with their popularity and duration.",
  "tutDetail6Title": "Photos and memories",
  "tutDetail6Desc": "Add photos of the concert and tag the people who were there. They are saved in your personal memories gallery.",
  "tutDetail7Title": "Venue and location",
  "tutDetail7Desc": "Tap the venue name to see all the concerts you have logged at that same place and explore its location on the map.",
  "tutDetail8Title": "Comments",
  "tutDetail8Desc": "Your friends can comment on the concert if you tagged them. Open the comments section to read or continue the conversation.",
  "tutDetail9Title": "Keep your ticket",
  "tutDetail9Desc": "Upload a photo or PDF of your ticket to always have it at hand. It is stored only on your device: it is never uploaded to any server.",

  "tutConcerts1Title": "Your music history",
  "tutConcerts1Desc": "All your concerts in one place. Past ones show the average rating of their criteria; future ones are marked as \"upcoming\".",
  "tutConcerts2Title": "Visible rating",
  "tutConcerts2Desc": "Each past concert shows its calculated score (average of criteria) or \"Not rated\" if you haven't scored it yet. Tap it to rate it.",
  "tutConcerts3Title": "Three available views",
  "tutConcerts3Desc": "Switch between list view, compact grid or calendar depending on how you prefer to explore your history.",
  "tutConcerts4Title": "Calendar view",
  "tutConcerts4Desc": "The calendar marks the days you had a concert. Tap any date to see the details or add a new one on that day.",
  "tutConcerts5Title": "Search and filter",
  "tutConcerts5Desc": "Use the search bar to find concerts by artist, venue or city, and filter by year to quickly browse your history.",
  "tutConcerts6Title": "Concert map",
  "tutConcerts6Desc": "Tap the map icon to see all your concerts on a map. Explore which cities and venues you've been to and spot patterns.",
  "tutConcerts7Title": "Shared",
  "tutConcerts7Desc": "The \"Shared\" tab gathers the concerts your friends added and tagged you in, even if you didn't log them yourself.",

  "tutStats1Title": "Your music stats",
  "tutStats1Desc": "A complete analysis of your history: total concerts, unique artists, cities visited, favorite genres, total spending and much more.",
  "tutStats2Title": "Concerts per year and month",
  "tutStats2Desc": "Bar charts showing how your concerts are distributed over time. Discover your most active seasons.",
  "tutStats3Title": "Top artists, genres and venues",
  "tutStats3Desc": "Rankings of the most-seen artists, the genres you've seen most live and the most-visited venues. With a Spotify photo when available.",
  "tutStats4Title": "Ratings and distribution",
  "tutStats4Desc": "Histogram of your scores, average rating per year and your top-rated artists. Only concerts scored with the criteria system are counted.",
  "tutStats5Title": "Festival vs. individual",
  "tutStats5Desc": "Pie chart showing the split between your festival concerts and individual ones, to get to know your profile as a concertgoer.",
  "tutStats6Title": "Yearly recap",
  "tutStats6Desc": "From the calendar icon you can open the Wrapped for any year: star artist, favorite city, average rating and the highlights.",
  "tutStats7Title": "Customize sections",
  "tutStats7Desc": "Choose which stats sections you want to see and reorder them as you like by tapping the edit icon.",

  "tutProfile1Title": "Your credentials",
  "tutProfile1Desc": "Your profile summarizes your whole music history: number of concerts, photos, favorites and your fan level based on how many shows you've racked up.",
  "tutProfile2Title": "Unlockable achievements",
  "tutProfile2Desc": "You earn badges for musical milestones: 10 concerts, your first festival, seeing the same artist again, getting a perfect rating and much more.",
  "tutProfile3Title": "My artists",
  "tutProfile3Desc": "Ranking of your most-seen artists, enriched with Spotify data: photo, followers, how many times you've seen them and your average rating of their shows.",
  "tutProfile4Title": "Yearly Wrapped",
  "tutProfile4Desc": "Open the animated recap of each year from your profile: artist of the year, favorite city, average rating and all your highlight concerts.",
  "tutProfile5Title": "Color theme",
  "tutProfile5Desc": "Customize the app's main color from the settings. Pick the one that best reflects your musical style.",

  "tutFriends1Title": "Connect with your people",
  "tutFriends1Desc": "Search for friends by name or email and send friend requests. Once they accept, you can see their concerts and compare histories.",
  "tutFriends2Title": "Friends and requests",
  "tutFriends2Desc": "The first tab lists your current friends. The second one manages the pending requests you've received.",
  "tutFriends3Title": "Friend profile",
  "tutFriends3Desc": "Tap a friend to see their profile: their concerts, favorite artists and achievements. You can explore their history even if it's private, as long as you're friends.",
  "tutFriends4Title": "Compare stats",
  "tutFriends4Desc": "From a friend's profile tap \"Compare\" to see your stats head to head: total concerts, common artists and average rating.",
  "tutFriends5Title": "Activity notifications",
  "tutFriends5Desc": "You get a notification when a friend adds a concert or tags you in one. You can also comment on their activity from the feed.",

  "tutFeed1Title": "Friends feed",
  "tutFeed1Desc": "Follow your friends' music activity in real time: which concerts they added, when and who they went with.",
  "tutFeed2Title": "Comment on concerts",
  "tutFeed2Desc": "Tap \"Comment\" on any activity to leave a message. Open the full thread to see the conversation and reply.",
  "tutFeed3Title": "Shared gallery",
  "tutFeed3Desc": "In the photos tab you see all the pictures you and your friends uploaded from your concerts, in chronological order.",

  "tutRecs1Title": "Concerts near you",
  "tutRecs1Desc": "Discover upcoming events based on your location and the artists you already follow in the app. Real-time data from Ticketmaster.",
  "tutRecs2Title": "Want to go",
  "tutRecs2Desc": "Mark an event as \"Want to go\" to save it to your list and find it quickly later.",
  "tutRecs3Title": "Add directly",
  "tutRecs3Desc": "If you already have a ticket for a recommended event, tap \"Add\" to log it in your history as an upcoming concert.",

  "tutImport1Title": "Search on Setlist.fm",
  "tutImport1Desc": "In the \"Setlist.fm\" tab, type an artist's name. The app will show their past concerts so you can pick the ones you attended.",
  "tutImport2Title": "Select and import",
  "tutImport2Desc": "Check the concerts in the list and tap \"Import\". They are added to your history automatically; afterwards you can edit each one to add a photo, price and rating.",
  "tutImport3Title": "Backup",
  "tutImport3Desc": "In the \"Backup\" tab you can export all your concerts to a file or restore them from a previous copy so you never lose anything.",

  "tutSpotifyPlaylist1Title": "Your Spotify playlist",
  "tutSpotifyPlaylist1Desc": "This screen shows the embedded Spotify player with your personal playlist. Each user sees their own thanks to OAuth access.",
  "tutSpotifyPlaylist2Title": "Link your account",
  "tutSpotifyPlaylist2Desc": "If you haven't linked Spotify yet, tap \"Connect with Spotify\" to authorize access. You only need to do it once.",
  "tutSpotifyPlaylist3Title": "Update permissions",
  "tutSpotifyPlaylist3Desc": "If you see the \"Re-link Spotify\" button, it means your session needs an additional permission to access playlists. Tap it to update it.",

  "tutSpotifyImport1Title": "Your Spotify artists",
  "tutSpotifyImport1Desc": "When you link your Spotify account, the app shows here the artists you listen to the most. Tap one to look up their past concerts on Setlist.fm.",
  "tutSpotifyImport2Title": "Import the artist's concerts",
  "tutSpotifyImport2Desc": "Tapping an artist opens the list of their past concerts. Select the ones you've seen and they are added straight to your history.",
  "tutSpotifyImport3Title": "Disconnect Spotify",
  "tutSpotifyImport3Desc": "Tap the exit icon in the top-right corner to unlink your Spotify account at any time.",

  "tutMap1Title": "Your music map",
  "tutMap1Desc": "All your concerts geolocated on the map. Each pin represents a concert; the most-visited cities are highlighted with larger markers.",
  "tutMap2Title": "Explore concerts",
  "tutMap2Desc": "Tap any pin to see the artist name, the venue and the date. From there you can open the full concert detail.",

